From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:30:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 274/333] [ae-patch] Ask before filing a pinned lead into a
 project, and fix the pin-spot wording (0273)

Dragging a pinned lead into a project or to Chats now asks about its family
before filing it; Cancel neither files nor unpins, and a family unpin from a
drop leaves no Undo pill, as the single unpin does. The dialog says 'pin
spot' when one is needed.
